    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Empire</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700500/extras/0d2ce207bd8b9c5523f48e773872d5e4.poster.avif?t=1730138188\" width=746 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700500/extras/0d2ce207bd8b9c5523f48e773872d5e4.webm?t=1730138188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700500/extras/0d2ce207bd8b9c5523f48e773872d5e4.mp4?t=1730138188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create sprawling settlements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage resources to keep your people alive as long as you can. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Empire</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your settlement into an empire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new buildings by completing challenges.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn Your Place on the Global Leaderboards</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you make a settlement that thrives better than anyone elses?\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700500/extras/6fc73fd3b95106127f6b5287614ce9d4.poster.avif?t=1730138188\" width=746 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700500/extras/6fc73fd3b95106127f6b5287614ce9d4.webm?t=1730138188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700500/extras/6fc73fd3b95106127f6b5287614ce9d4.mp4?t=1730138188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your town's resources to ensure your villagers don't starve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your town using a wide selection of unlockable buildings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
